    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      475.04,
      286.42,
      553.99
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of land marked as Lot No. 1269 in total extent of 7.5496 Hectares depicted in F.V.P. 658 additional 52 of 13.09.2010 made by Surveyor General situated in the village of Ihalagoda, 109 B Ihalagoda South Grama Niladhari Division in Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Akmeemana District of Galle Southern Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
