      353.36
    ],
    "text": "room; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: Land Reforms Commission; Extent: 7.5496 Hectares.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      354.8,
      539.41,
      499.73
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands* on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat Akmeemana on the 08th day of June, 2016 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 01st day of June, 2016 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation and the details of the said land /servitude* , the amount of Componsation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
